# raw per-run files (traces, logs, receipts, outcomes, stores, plans): kept locally; committed are the summary,
# the log tails, the gzipped plans and the comparisons (fpcompare / crosscheck)
*
!.gitignore
# summary.jsonl: added when the batch is complete
!*.tail.txt
!*.plan.json.gz
!fpcompare.json
!*.crosscheck.json
